ce the drip must run on the shared fight tick through the one ledger.", "decision_status": "proposed", "acceptance": "A player sees a red gib drop and a short camera shake every 2.4 s while bleeding after a landed hit, and the bleed stops once HP is at the floor; a server test asserts each drip is one ledger entry of 1 + MAXHP / 30 minus CON / 5 (floor 1; without the random share unless Strategy keeps it), a normal hit on a bleeding target does not extend the bleed, and no drip applies when HP is at or below 5 + CON."}